OL,3,ALockerbie bombing accused loses bid to
OL,4,Ahave case thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Libyan man accused of building the
OL,7,Fbomb that brought down an American
OL,8,Fairliner over Lockerbie nearly 38 years
OL,9,Fago has lost his bid to have the case
OL,10,Fthrown out of court.
OL,12,FAbu Agila Mas'ud al-Marimi had claimed
OL,13,Fhe was the victim of an illegal
OL,14,Frendition when he was transferred into
OL,15,FUS custody from Libya in 2022.
OL,17,FA US district court judge has ruled
OL,18,Fthat the manner of his removal should
OL,19,Fnot prevent his trial going ahead in
OL,20,FWashington in January.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
