OL,3,ALockerbie bombing accused loses bid to
OL,4,Ahave case thrown out
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarimi has denied playing a key role in
OL,7,Fthe attack on Pan Am 103, which killed
OL,8,F270 people on 21 December 1988.
